{
    "comment": "예약 작업 탭 위의 상태 카드 넷 — 스케줄러 · 작업 수 · 최근 결과 · 큐.\n  ① 스케줄러는 **하트비트**(매분 찍히는 마지막 틱)로 판정한다. 3분 안에 찍혔으면 정상, 넘었거나 한 번도 없으면\n     서버 cron 에 스케줄러가 걸려 있지 않은 것이라 등록 안내를 띄운다 — 등록된 작업이 있어도 이게 멈추면 아무것도 돌지 않는다.\n  ② ③ 은 목록 응답의 통계(`schedules.data.statistics`), ④ 는 상태 응답의 큐 요약이다. 큐 탭의 큐 현황 카드도 같은 4칸 틀이다.\n     대기 건수는 database 드라이버일 때만 셀 수 있다(그 밖이면 「측정 불가」).\n     상태를 받기 전에는 「멈춤」·「측정 불가」를 그리지 않고 큐 숫자는 흐린다(#915 — 받기 전 값은 undefined 라 「없음」으로 읽힌다).\n  넓은 화면은 4칸, 태블릿은 2×2. 휴대폰은 상태를 한 줄로 요약하고(시안 「모바일: 상태 한 줄」), 「자세히」를 눌러야\n  카드 넷이 한 칸씩 펼쳐진다 — 카드 넷이 세로로 쌓이면 목록이 화면 두 장 아래에서 시작했다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true
    },
    "layout_name": "status_card",
    "id": "schedule_status_area",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "schedule_status_line",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{false}}",
            "responsive": {
                "mobile": {
                    "if": "{{true}}"
                }
            },
            "props": {
                "className": "admin-card flex-between gap-3 mb-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "min-w-0"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex items-center gap-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "heart-pulse",
                                        "className": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy ? 'text-green-500' : 'text-red-500'}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.healthy"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{schedule_status !== undefined && (!schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy)}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.stopped"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago !== null && schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago !== undefined}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.mobile_summary|minutes={{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago}}|alive={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.alive ?? 0}}|registered={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.registered ?? 0}}|failed={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.failed ?? 0}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago === null || schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago === undefined}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.mobile_summary_never|alive={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.alive ?? 0}}|registered={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.registered ?? 0}}|failed={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.failed ?? 0}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "schedule_status_detail_toggle",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "자세히/접기 — 휴대폰에서 카드 넷을 펼치거나 접는다(이 화면 안에서만 쓰는 펼침 상태라 지역에 둔다).",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "local",
                                "statusDetailOpen": "{{!_local.statusDetailOpen}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0",
                        "aria-expanded": "{{_local.statusDetailOpen === true}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{!_local.statusDetailOpen}}",
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.detail_open"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{_local.statusDetailOpen}}",
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.detail_close"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "schedule_status_cards",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "responsive": {
                "tablet": {
                    "props": {
                        "className": "grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"
                    }
                },
                "mobile": {
                    "if": "{{_local.statusDetailOpen === true}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-4"
                    }
                }
            },
            "props": {
                "className": "grid-2col grid-cols-4 mb-6"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "scheduler_heartbeat_card",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "admin-card"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.scheduler"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "heart-pulse",
                                        "className": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy ? 'text-xl text-green-500' : 'text-xl text-red-500'}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-2xl font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.healthy"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.last_tick|minutes={{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago ?? 0}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status !== undefined && (!schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.healthy)}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.stopped"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago !== null && schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago !== undefined}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.last_tick|minutes={{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago === null || schedule_status?.data?.heartbeat?.minutes_ago === undefined}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.never_ticked"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.cron_hint"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Code",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "block mt-1 text-xs bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 break-all"
                                    },
                                    "text": "* * * * * php artisan schedule:run"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "schedule_count_card",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "admin-card"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.schedules"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "clock",
                                        "className": "text-xl text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "blur_until_loaded": {
                                "enabled": true,
                                "data_sources": "schedules"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-page-heading mt-2"
                            },
                            "text": "{{schedules?.data?.statistics?.total ?? 0}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "blur_until_loaded": {
                                "enabled": true,
                                "data_sources": "schedules"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.active_inactive|active={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.active ?? 0}}|inactive={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.inactive ?? 0}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "schedule_result_card",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "admin-card"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.results"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "circle-xmark",
                                        "className": "{{(schedules?.data?.statistics?.failed ?? 0) > 0 ? 'text-xl text-red-500' : 'text-xl text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500'}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "blur_until_loaded": {
                                "enabled": true,
                                "data_sources": "schedules"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "{{(schedules?.data?.statistics?.failed ?? 0) > 0 ? 'mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400' : 'mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white'}}"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.failed_count|count={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.failed ?? 0}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "blur_until_loaded": {
                                "enabled": true,
                                "data_sources": "schedules"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.success_never|success={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.success ?? 0}}|never={{schedules?.data?.statistics?.never_run ?? 0}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "queue_summary_card",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "admin-card"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.queue|driver={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.driver ?? '-'}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "layer-group",
                                        "className": "text-xl text-blue-500"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.measurable}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-page-heading mt-2"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.pending_count|count={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.pending_count ?? 0}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{schedule_status !== undefined && (!schedule_status?.data?.queue?.measurable)}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.pending_unmeasurable"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "blur_until_loaded": {
                                "enabled": true,
                                "data_sources": "schedule_status"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-tertiary mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.schedules.status_card.queue_detail|failed={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.failed_count ?? 0}}|alive={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.alive ?? 0}}|registered={{schedule_status?.data?.queue?.workers?.registered ?? 0}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
